menu "Avela clock"

    config AVELA_TIME_ZONE
        string "Time zone (POSIX TZ)"
        default "CET-1CEST,M3.5.0,M10.5.0/3"
        help
            The local time zone with its daylight-saving rule, as a POSIX TZ string. The default is Central
            European Time (Poland). The clock itself is set over the internet (SNTP) once Wi-Fi is joined.

endmenu
